{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56513","headline":"巨胜歌（幷序） 二 · 柳冲用","name":"巨胜歌（幷序） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龟蛇体殊异，铅汞共宗祖。\n二女虽同居，良媒分子母。\n配合由三花，青龙句白虎。\n四象既可凭，五神当有主。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳冲用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}